aper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a6cbc6d0ddb7e4831c62afe/dvsa-mot-05-mot-class-7-vehicles-initial-failures-by-defect-category.csv"},{"accessible":true,"alternative_format_contact_email":"accessible-formats@dvsa-publishing.zendesk.com","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"6a708b041f66ec7b77ed4663","filename":"dvsa-mot-06-mot-test-stations-and-testers.csv"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"text/csv","file_size":557,"filename":"dvsa-mot-06-mot-test-stations-and-testers.csv","id":"9167360","isbn":"","title":"MOT test stations and testers","unique_reference":"DVSA/MOT/06","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a708b041f66ec7b77ed4663/dvsa-mot-06-mot-test-stations-and-testers.csv"},{"accessible":true,"alternative_format_contact_email":"accessible-formats@dvsa-publishing.zendesk.com","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"6a708a3be348732cfe958bc7","filename":"dvsa-mot-07-action-against-authorised-examiners-and-testers.csv"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"text/csv","file_size":4734,"filename":"dvsa-mot-07-action-against-authorised-examiners-and-testers.csv","id":"9167361","isbn":"","title":"Action against authorised examiners and testers","unique_reference":"DVSA/MOT/07","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a708a3be348732cfe958bc7/dvsa-mot-07-action-against-authorised-examiners-and-testers.csv"}],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><h2 id=\"about-this-data-set\">About this data set</h2>\n\n<p>This data set comes from data held by the Driver and Vehicle Standards Agency (<abbr title=\"Driver and Vehicle Standards Agency\">DVSA</abbr>).</p>\n\n<p>It is not classed as an ‘official statistic’. This means it’s not subject to scrutiny and assessment by the UK Statistics Authority.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"mot-test-results-by-class\">MOT test results by class</h2>\n\n<p>The MOT test checks that your vehicle meets road safety and environmental standards. Different types of vehicles (for example, cars and motorcycles) fall into different ‘classes’.</p>\n\n<p>This data table shows the number of initial tests. It does not include abandoned tests, aborted tests, or retests.</p>\n\n<p>The initial fail rate is the rate for vehicles as they were brought for the MOT. The final fail rate excludes vehicles that pass the test after rectification of minor defects at the time of the test.</p>\n\n<p>This data table is updated every 3 months.</p>\n\n<section data-module=\"ga4-link-tracker\" class=\"gem-c-attachment govuk-!-margin-bottom-6\">\n  <div class=\"gem-c-attachment__thumbnail govuk-!-display-none-print\">\n    <a class=\"govuk-link\" target=\"_self\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-ga4-link='{\"event_name\":\"file_download\",\"type\":\"attachment\"}' href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a6cbc31cceb23e8678977c3/dvsa-mot-01-mot-test-results-by-class-of-vehicle.csv\">\n        <svg class=\"gem-c-attachment__thumbnail-image gem-c-attachment__thumbnail-image--spreadsheet\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"0 0 99 140\" width=\"99\" height=\"140\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n  <path d=\"M12 12h75v27H12zm0 47h18.75v63H12zm55 2v59H51V61h16m2-2H49v63h20V59z\" stroke-width=\"0\"></path>\n  <path d=\"M49 61.05V120H32.8V61.05H49m2-2H30.75v63H51V59zm34 2V120H69.05V61.05H85m2-2H67v63h20V59z\" stroke-width=\"0\"></path>\n  <path d=\"M30 68.5h56.5M30 77.34h56.5M30 112.7h56.5M30 95.02h56.5M30 86.18h56.5M30 103.86h56.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path>\n</svg>\n\n</a>\n</div>\n  <div class=\"gem-c-attachment__details\">\n    <h2 class=\"gem-c-attachment__title\">\n      <a class=\"govuk-link\" target=\"_self\" data-ga4-link='{\"event_name\":\"file_download\",\"type\":\"attachment\"}' href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a6cbc31cceb23e8678977c3/dvsa-mot-01-mot-test-results-by-class-of-vehicle.csv\">MOT test results by class of vehicle</a>\n</h2>\n      <p class=\"gem-c-attachment__metadata gem-c-attachment__metadata--compact\">Ref: DVSA/MOT/01</p>\n\n\n      <p class=\"gem-c-attachment__metadata\"><span class=\"gem-c-attachment__attribute\"><abbr title=\"Comma-separated Values\" class=\"gem-c-attachment__abbr\">CSV</abbr></span>, <span class=\"gem-c-attachment__attribute\">33.3 KB</span></p>\n\n      <p class=\"gem-c-attachment__metadata\"><a class=\"govuk-link\" aria-label=\"View MOT test results by class of vehicle online\" href=\"/csv-preview/6a6cbc31cceb23e8678977c3/dvsa-mot-01-mot-test-results-by-class-of-vehicle.csv\">View online</a></p>\n\n\n\n</div></section>\n\n<h2 id=\"initial-failures-by-defect-category\">Initial failures by defect category</h2>\n\n<p>These tables give data for the following classes of vehicles:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>class 1 and 2 vehicles - motorcycles</li>\n  <li>class 3 and 4 vehicles - cars and light vans up to 3,000kg</li>\n  <li>class 5 vehicles - private passenger vehicles with more than 12 seats</li>\n  <li>class 7 vehicles - goods vehicles between 3,000kg and 3,500kg gross vehicle weight</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>All figures are for vehicles as they were brought in for the MOT.</p>\n\n<p>A failed test usually has multiple failure items.</p>\n\n<p>The percentage of tests is worked out as the number of tests with one or more failure items in the defect as a percentage of total tests.</p>\n\n<p>The percentage of defects is worked out as the total defects in the category as a percentage of total defects for all categories.</p>\n\n<p>The average defects per initial test failure is worked out as the total failure items as a percentage of total tests failed plus tests that passed after rectification of a minor defect at the time of the test.</p>\n\n<p>These data tables are updated every 3 months.</p>\n\n<section data-module=\"ga4-link-tracker\" class=\"gem-c-attachment govuk-!-margin-bottom-6\">\n  <div class=\"gem-c-attachment__thumbnail govuk-!-display-none-print\">\n    <a class=\"govuk-link\" target=\"_self\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-ga4-link='{\"event_name\":\"file_download\",\"type\":\"attachment\"}' href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a6cbc3e862aaf18d9c62aff/dvsa-mot-02-mot-class-1-and-2-vehicles-initial-failures-by-defect-category.csv\">\n        <svg class=\"gem-c-attachment__thumbnail-image gem-c-attachment__thumbnail-image--spreadsheet\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"0 0 99 140\" width=\"99\" height=\"140\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n  <path d=\"M12 12h75v27H12zm0 47h18.75v63H12zm55 2v59H51V61h16m2-2H49v63h20V59z\" stroke-width=\"0\"></path>\n  <path d=\"M49 61.05V120H32.8V61.05H49m2-2H30.75v63H51V59zm34 2V120H69.05V61.05H85m2-2H67v63h20V59z\" stroke-width=\"0\"></path>\n  <path d=\"M30 68.5h56.5M30 77.34h56.5M30 112.7h56.5M30 95.02h56.5M30 86.18h56.5M30 103.86h56.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path>\n</svg>\n\n</a>\n</div>\n  <div class=\"gem-c-attachment__details\">\n    <h2 class=\"gem-c-attachment__title\">\n      <a class=\"govuk-link\" target=\"_self\" data-ga4-link='{\"event_name\":\"file_download\",\"type\":\"attachment\"}' href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a6cbc3e862aaf18d9c62aff/dvsa-mot-02-mot-class-1-and-2-vehicles-initial-failures-by-defect-category.csv\">MOT class 1 and 2 vehicles: initial failures by defect category</a>\n</h2>\n      <p class=\"gem-c-attachment__metadata gem-c-attachment__metadata--compact\">Ref: DVSA/MOT/02</p>\n\n\n      <p class=\"gem-c-attachment__metadata\"><span class=\"gem-c-attachment__attribute\"><abbr title=\"Comma-separated Values\" class=\"gem-c-attachment__abbr\">CSV</abbr></span>, <span class=\"gem-c-attachment__attribute\">44.7 KB</span></p>\n\n      <p class=\"gem-c-attachment__metadata\"><a class=\"govuk-link\" aria-label=\"View MOT class 1 and 2 vehicles: initial failures by defect category online\" href=\"/csv-preview/6a6cbc3e862aaf18d9c62aff/dvsa-mot-02-mot-class-1-and-2-vehicles-initial-failures-by-defect-category.csv\">View online</a></p>\n\n\n\n</div></section>\n\n<section data-module=\"ga4-link-tracker\" class=\"gem-c-attachment govuk-!-margin-bottom-6\">\n  <div class=\"gem-c-attachment__thumbnail govuk-!-display-none-print\">\n    <a class=\"govuk-link\" target=\"_self\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-ga4-link='{\"event_name\":\"file_download\",\"type\":\"attachment\"}' href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a6cbc4c8319ab05f7caa2e7/dvsa-mot-03-mot-class-3-and-4-vehicles-initial-failures-by-defect-category.csv\">\n        <svg class=\"gem-c-attachment__thumbnail-image gem-c-attachment__thumbnail-image--spreadsheet\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"0 0 99 140\" width=\"99\" height=\"140\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n  <path d=\"M12 12h75v27H12zm0 47h18.75v63H12zm55 2v59H51V61h16m2-2H49v63h20V59z\" stroke-width=\"0\"></path>\n  <path d=\"M49 61.05V120H32.8V61.05H49m2-2H30.75v63H51V59zm34 2V120H69.05V61.05H85m2-2H67v63h20V59z\" stroke-width=\"0\"></path>\n  <path d=\"M30 68.5h56.5M30 77.34h56.5M30 112.7h56.5M30 95.02h56.5M30 86.18h56.5M30 103.86h56.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path>\n</svg>\n\n</a>\n</div>\n  <div class=\"gem-c-attachment__details\">\n    <h2 class=\"gem-c-attachment__title\">\n      <a class=\"govuk-link\" target=\"_self\" data-ga4-link='{\"event_name\":\"file_download\",\"type\":\"attachment\"}' href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a6cbc4c8319ab05f7caa2e7/dvsa-mot-03-mot-class-3-and-4-vehicles-initial-failures-by-defect-category.csv\">MOT class 3 and 4 vehicles: initial failures by defect category</a>\n</h2>\n      <p class=\"gem-c-attachment__metadata gem-c-attachment__metadata--compact\">Ref: DVSA/MOT/03</p>\n\n\n      <p class=\"gem-c-attachment__metadata\"><span class=\"gem-c-attachment__attribute\"><abbr title=\"Comma-separated Values\" class=\"gem-c-attachment__abbr\">CSV</abbr></span>, <span class=\"gem-c-attachment__attribute\">66.9 KB</span></p>\n\n      <p class=\"gem-c-attachment__metadata\"><a class=\"govuk-link\" aria-label=\"View MOT class 3 and 4 vehicles: initial failures by defect category online\" href=\"/csv-preview/6a6cbc4c8319ab05f7caa2e7/dvsa-mot-03-mot-class-3-and-4-vehicles-initial-failures-by-defect-category.csv\">View online</a></p>\n\n\n\n</div></section>\n\n<section data-module=\"ga4-link-tracker\" class=\"gem-c-attachment govuk-!-margin-bottom-6\">\n  <div class=\"gem-c-attachment__thumbnail govuk-!-display-none-print\">\n    <a class=\"govuk-link\" target=\"_self\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-ga4-link='{\"event_name\":\"file_download\",\"type\":\"attachment\"}' href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a6cbc5c0ddb7e4831c62afc/dvsa-mot-04-mot-class-5-vehicles-initial-failures-by-defect-category.csv\">\n        <svg class=\"gem-c-attachment__thumbnail-image gem-c-attachment__thumbnail-image--spreadsheet\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"0 0 99 140\" width=\"99\" height=\"140\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n  <path d=\"M12 12h75v27H12zm0 47h18.75v63H12zm55 2v59H51V61h16m2-2H49v63h20V59z\" stroke-width=\"0\"></path>\n  <path d=\"M49 61.05V120H32.8V61.05H49m2-2H30.75v63H51V59zm34 2V120H69.05V61.05H85m2-2H67v63h20V59z\" stroke-width=\"0\"></path>\n  <path d=\"M30 68.5h56.5M30 77.34h56.5M30 112.7h56.5M30 95.02h56.5M30 86.18h56.5M30 103.86h56.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path>\n</svg>\n\n</a>\n</div>\n  <div class=\"gem-c-attachment__details\">\n    <h2 class=\"gem-c-attachment__title\">\n      <a class=\"govuk-link\" target=\"_self\" data-ga4-link='{\"event_name\":\"file_download\",\"type\":\"attachment\"}' href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a6cbc5c0ddb7e4831c62afc/dvsa-mot-04-mot-class-5-vehicles-initial-failures-by-defect-category.csv\">MOT class 5 vehicles: initial failures by defect category</a>\n</h2>\n      <p class=\"gem-c-attachment__metadata gem-c-attachment__metadata--compact\">Ref: DVSA/MOT/04</p>\n\n\n      <p class=\"gem-c-attachment__metadata\"><span class=\"gem-c-attachment__attribute\"><abbr title=\"Comma-separated Values\" class=\"gem-c-attachment__abbr\">CSV</abbr></span>, <span class=\"gem-c-attachment__attribute\">60.5 KB</span></p>\n\n      <p class=\"gem-c-attachment__metadata\"><a class=\"govuk-link\" aria-label=\"View MOT class 5 vehicles: initial failures by defect category online\" href=\"/csv-preview/6a6cbc5c0ddb7e4831c62afc/dvsa-mot-04-mot-class-5-vehicles-initial-failures-by-defect-category.csv\">View online</a></p>\n\n\n\n</div></section>\n\n<section data-module=\"ga4-link-tracker\" class=\"gem-c-attachment govuk-!-margin-bottom-6\">\n  <div class=\"gem-c-attachment__thumbnail govuk-!-display-none-print\">\n    <a class=\"govuk-link\" target=\"_self\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-ga4-link='{\"event_name\":\"file_download\",\"type\":\"attachment\"}' href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a6cbc6d0ddb7e4831c62afe/dvsa-mot-05-mot-class-7-vehicles-initial-failures-by-defect-category.csv\">\n        <svg class=\"gem-c-attachment__thumbnail-image gem-c-attachment__thumbnail-image--spreadsheet\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"0 0 99 140\" width=\"99\" height=\"140\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n  <path d=\"M12 12h75v27H12zm0 47h18.75v63H12zm55 2v59H51V61h16m2-2H49v63h20V59z\" stroke-width=\"0\"></path>\n  <path d=\"M49 61.05V120H32.8V61.05H49m2-2H30.75v63H51V59zm34 2V120H69.05V61.05H85m2-2H67v63h20V59z\" stroke-width=\"0\"></path>\n  <path d=\"M30 68.5h56.5M30 77.34h56.5M30 112.7h56.5M30 95.02h56.5M30 86.18h56.5M30 103.86h56.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path>\n</svg>\n\n</a>\n</div>\n  <div class=\"gem-c-attachment__details\">\n    <h2 class=\"gem-c-attachment__title\">\n      <a class=\"govuk-link\" target=\"_self\" data-ga4-link='{\"event_name\":\"file_download\",\"type\":\"attachment\"}' href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a6cbc6d0ddb7e4831c62afe/dvsa-mot-05-mot-class-7-vehicles-initial-failures-by-defect-category.csv\">MOT class 7 vehicles: initial failures by defect category</a>\n</h2>\n      <p class=\"gem-c-attachment__metadata gem-c-attachment__metadata--compact\">Ref: DVSA/MOT/05</p>\n\n\n      <p class=\"gem-c-attachment__metadata\"><span class=\"gem-c-attachment__attribute\"><abbr title=\"Comma-separated Values\" class=\"gem-c-attachment__abbr\">CSV</abbr></span>, <span class=\"gem-c-attachment__attribute\">53 KB</span></p>\n\n      <p class=\"gem-c-attachment__metadata\"><a class=\"govuk-link\" aria-label=\"View MOT class 7 vehicles: initial failures by defect category online\" href=\"/csv-preview/6a6cbc6d0ddb7e4831c62afe/dvsa-mot-05-mot-class-7-vehicles-initial-failures-by-defect-category.csv\">View online</a></p>\n\n\n\n</div></section>\n\n<h2 id=\"mot-test-stations-and-testers\">MOT test stations and testers</h2>\n\n<p>You must have an authorised test station to carry out MOTs, and you have to be approved as an MOT tester. Other MOT stations include:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>post office operated test stations</li>\n  <li>designated local authorities</li>\n  <li>the Crown</li>\n  <li>some police authorities</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>This data table is updated once a year.</p>\n\n<section data-module=\"ga4-link-tracker\" class=\"gem-c-attachment govuk-!-margin-bottom-6\">\n  <div class=\"gem-c-attachment__thumbnail govuk-!-display-none-print\">\n    <a class=\"govuk-link\" target=\"_self\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-ga4-link='{\"event_name\":\"file_download\",\"type\":\"attachment\"}' href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a708b041f66ec7b77ed4663/dvsa-mot-06-mot-test-stations-and-testers.csv\">\n        <svg class=\"gem-c-attachment__thumbnail-image gem-c-attachment__thumbnail-image--spreadsheet\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"0 0 99 140\" width=\"99\" height=\"140\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n  <path d=\"M12 12h75v27H12zm0 47h18.75v63H12zm55 2v59H51V61h16m2-2H49v63h20V59z\" stroke-width=\"0\"></path>\n  <path d=\"M49 61.05V120H32.8V61.05H49m2-2H30.75v63H51V59zm34 2V120H69.05V61.05H85m2-2H67v63h20V59z\" stroke-width=\"0\"></path>\n  <path d=\"M30 68.5h56.5M30 77.34h56.5M30 112.7h56.5M30 95.02h56.5M30 86.18h56.5M30 103.86h56.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path>\n</svg>\n\n</a>\n</div>\n  <div class=\"gem-c-attachment__details\">\n    <h2 class=\"gem-c-attachment__title\">\n      <a class=\"govuk-link\" target=\"_self\" data-ga4-link='{\"event_name\":\"file_download\",\"type\":\"attachment\"}' href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a708b041f66ec7b77ed4663/dvsa-mot-06-mot-test-stations-and-testers.csv\">MOT test stations and testers</a>\n</h2>\n      <p class=\"gem-c-attachment__metadata gem-c-attachment__metadata--compact\">Ref: DVSA/MOT/06</p>\n\n\n      <p class=\"gem-c-attachment__metadata\"><span class=\"gem-c-attachment__attribute\"><abbr title=\"Comma-separated Values\" class=\"gem-c-attachment__abbr\">CSV</abbr></span>, <span class=\"gem-c-attachment__attribute\">557 Bytes</span></p>\n\n      <p class=\"gem-c-attachment__metadata\"><a class=\"govuk-link\" aria-label=\"View MOT test stations and testers online\" href=\"/csv-preview/6a708b041f66ec7b77ed4663/dvsa-mot-06-mot-test-stations-and-testers.csv\">View online</a></p>\n\n\n\n</div></section>\n\n<h2 id=\"action-against-mot-authorised-examiners-and-mot-testers\">Action against MOT authorised examiners and MOT testers</h2>\n\n<p><abbr title=\"Driver and Vehicle Standards Agency\">DVSA</abbr> can take disciplinary action or stop you operating as a testing station or tester if your service is not good enough.</p>\n\n<p>This data table is updated once a year.</p>\n\n<section data-module=\"ga4-link-tracker\" class=\"gem-c-attachment govuk-!-margin-bottom-6\">\n  <div class=\"gem-c-attachment__thumbnail govuk-!-display-none-print\">\n    <a class=\"govuk-link\" target=\"_self\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-ga4-link='{\"event_name